 om Colleen Hoover's best-selling novel\, this seductive\, psychological th
 riller follows renowned author Verity Crawford (Anne Hathaway) and Lowen A
 shleigh (Dakota Johnson)\, a struggling writer who relocates to the remote
  Crawford estate to ghostwrite for Verity. After Lowen uncovers what appea
 rs to be Verity's chilling autobiographical notes\, she wrestles with the 
 disturbing and twisted confessions about Verity’s husband Jeremy (Josh H
 artnett)\, and finds it hard to separate fiction from reality\, manipulati
 on from attraction\, and opportunity from obsession.\nhttps://www.phoenixm
 ovies.net/movies/verity/HO00001763\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pus
 hpin.city/westernma/
